== Title ==
Moved from [[Reflections III: A Collector's Bounty]]. "A Collector's Bounty" is the subtitle of the first [[Reflections]] set, not of Reflections III (Decipher cardlists, in-box collector's card list, packaging). [[User:Datacard Grok|Datacard Grok]] ([[User talk:Datacard Grok|talk]]) 15:28, 9 November 2026 (UTC)

== Style pass (2026-10-15) ==
=== Marginal cuts ===
* Lead: "CardGuide numbering: 31st product (CardGuide lists 113 unique-to-list cards)." Cut as catalog bookkeeping; uncited.
* Lead foil breakdown ("42 very rare foils, 54 super rare foils, 4 ultra rare foils") cut from the lead; it remains under Possible foils.
* Sources list removed. Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2 was already cited (ref "encyc"); Decipher.com cardlists is now a ref on the Card list mention. Not tied to any sentence, so moved here:
** [https://www.starwarsccg.org/collecting/ SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia] at starwarsccg.org
** [https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Reflections_III Reflections III] at Wookieepedia
=== Missing data ===
